alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/26-189.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:189 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Basi walimkanusha, na ikawashika adhabu ya siku ya kivuli. Hakika hiyo ilikuwa adhabu ya siku kubwa.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Mwanzo\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Ash-Shu'araa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/surah/26.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 189\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/26-189.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/26.html\">Sura Ash-Shu&#x27;araa</a> › Aya 189</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:189</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فَكَذَّبُوهُ فَأَخَذَهُمْ عَذَابُ يَوْمِ الظُّلَّةِ إِنَّهُ كَانَ عَذَابَ يَوْمٍ عَظِيمٍ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Basi walimkanusha, na ikawashika adhabu ya siku ya kivuli. Hakika hiyo ilikuwa adhabu ya siku kubwa.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وجمع لهم بين الثلاثة فإن الرجفة بدأت بهم فأصحروا إلى الفضاء خوفا من سقوط الأبنية عليهم فصهرتهم الشمس بحرها ورفعت لهم الظلة فأهرعوا إليها يستظلون بها من الشمس فنزل عليهم منها العذاب وفيه الصيحة<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 1/126</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s26a189\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/26-123.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (26:123)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/26-192.html\">Aya inayofuata (26:192)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/26-192.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:192 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Na bila ya shaka hii ni Uteremsho wa Mola Mlezi wa walimwengu wote.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/26-192.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/26-192.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/26-192.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhai